>
> There is no reason to be careful around nymphs - all you need to do is
> not hit _them_, but you can zap as closely past them as you wish, or

Nymphs are one of the few monsters I don't want to hit with force bolt
or striking.

> smash doors, or whatever you desire.

Doors are the main reason I want to be careful about nymphs when
practicing force bolt.  Smashing a door wakes monsters sleeping on that
level.

> And there is no need to zap at
> monsters, or at anything at all - all you need to do is cast the spell
> successfully. You don't need to hit anything.

So when casting at the wall be sure there are no secret doors there, or
be certain there are no nymphs sleeping on the level.


